# TRACK CODES (0.17.11): PLAY starts a fresh track with its own code; the same code started again plays the same notes at the same
# times, whatever was playing before (another genre, the knobs turned); the Code page (GLO, third) shows it and takes one typed in
seed 0
wait 2500
expect playing 1
# a fresh track: its notes for 20 s kept, and its code
hasharm 20000
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
tap PLAY
wait 22000
hashkeep
codekeep
expect codeexact 1
# elsewhere a while: another genre, Evolve turned
tap GLO
wait 200
expect view 32
spin K4 3
wait 12000
tap HOME
spin K2 10
wait 6000
# the code again: the same notes
hasharm 20000
code
wait 22000
expect hashsame 1
expect codeexact 1
# and from stopped, a third time
tap PLAY
wait 3000
hasharm 20000
code
wait 22000
expect hashsame 1
# PLAY: a fresh one (other notes)
hasharm 20000
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 22000
expect hashsame 0
# the Code page: GLO three times; a letter typed is a code of its own (the check letter follows); PLAY starts it
tap GLO
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 200
expect view 34
spin K1 2
spin K2 1
wait 200
shot code_typed.png
tap PLAY
wait 2000
expect playing 1
expect codeexact 1
shot code_page.png
# a minute in a genre with a time plan (double time after the drop) and the wobble: the same again
tap GLO
wait 100
expect view 32
spin K4 3
wait 3000
hasharm 60000
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 62000
hashkeep
codekeep
tap GLO
spin K4 5
wait 8000
hasharm 60000
code
wait 62000
expect hashsame 1
